#: ../../source/templates_wise.md:78
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_wise.md:79
msgid ""
"**Weight 900 as identity**: Wise Sans Black (900) is used exclusively for"
" display — the heaviest weight in any analyzed system. It creates text "
"that feels stamped, pressed, physical."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_wise.md:80
msgid ""
"**0.85 line-height**: The tightest display line-height analyzed. Letters "
"overlap vertically, creating dense, billboard-like text blocks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_wise.md:81
msgid ""
"**\"calt\" everywhere**: Contextual alternates enabled on ALL text — both"
" Wise Sans and Inter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_wise.md:82
msgid ""
"**Weight 600 as body default**: Inter Semibold is the standard reading "
"weight — confident, not light."
msgstr ""

